  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n**→ (4² + 4) : (4³ + 4)**\n\n→ 4² + 4 = 16 + 4 = 20\n\n→ 4³ + 4 = 64 + 4 = 68\n\n→ 20 : 68 \n\nSimilarly,\n\n**→ (3² + 3) : (3³ + 3)**\n\n→ 3² + 3 = 9 + 3 = 12\n\n→ 3³ + 3 = 27 + 3 = 30\n\n→ 12 : 30 \n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"12 : 30\".**",
